# Game_Timer — Countdown Timer per Player (ID 16)
# Files: src/coordinator/Game_Timer.h, Game_Timer.cpp
# HTML: data/game_timer_setup.html, game_timer_names.html, game_timer_run.html

## GAMEPLAY
Individual countdown timers for 1-10 players. EFF_PROGRESS shows remaining time as LED fill.
Players can pause, add/subtract time. Click to finish early.

## CONFIG
- numPlayers (1-10), globalBaseTime (ms), globalBrightness (10-100%)

## STATES per player
TS_RUNNING, TS_PAUSED, TS_FINISHED_EARLY, TS_TIME_UP, TS_STOPPED

## KEY MECHANICS
- Delta time calculation: timeLeft -= elapsed each loop
- Fill level: (timeLeft * 255) / initialTime → EFF_PROGRESS
- Optimization: only send if fill changes AND 100ms throttle
- Global brightness scaling applied in setPuck()
- modifyTime(): adjust per-player, expand initialTime if needed

## COMMANDS
setup, cfg_players, cfg_time (seconds), set_bright (10-100), start, reset, stop, exit,
p_add10/30/60, p_sub10/30/60, p_pause, p_res, p_stop (per player via value param)

## STATUS JSON
{active, maxTimeLeft, finishedCount, totalCount, players: [{id, state, timeLeft}]}
